			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. Draft the [[Dark Room.canvas|Dark Room]] and enter it to make the power on the room trip out.\n2. Draft the [[031 - Utility Closet.canvas|031 - Utility Closet]] and then turn the power on the [[Dark Room.canvas|Dark Room]] on again.\n3. Enter the [[Dark Room.canvas|Dark Room]] to see that it is now on and you can explore inside.",
